---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How this site handles your data.">
  <div class="content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      This is a static website. It does not run a database, set tracking cookies,
      or collect personal information by default.
    </p>

    <h2>Forms</h2>
    <p>
      The contact form is a demo and is not connected to a backend. If you wire it
      up to a form service, that service's privacy policy will apply to any data
      you submit.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      No analytics are enabled in this build. If you add an analytics provider,
      update this page to describe what is collected.
    </p>

    <p><em>This is placeholder copy. Replace it with your own privacy policy before going live.</em></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
